        // its USD original and its rate.
        eq("S14: a new amount, 80 EUR, scales the stored conversion (6,000 x 80/90 = 5,333.33 DOP, orig 88.89 USD @60)", await twin(), "5333.33 DOP orig 88.89 USD @60");
